WEBVTT

00:00:01.179 --> 00:00:05.246
One more thing to think about. Why can the balloon number come out low?

00:00:05.896 --> 00:00:09.243
First, a little air can leak out before you pinch the neck.

00:00:11.893 --> 00:00:16.307
Second, the balloon pushes back on the air inside, and it isn't a perfect ball.

00:00:19.357 --> 00:00:24.213
Keep both ideas in mind for the question about why the balloon value is lowest.
